# Insidious Roots {B}{G}: "Whenever one or more creature cards leave your graveyard, create a 0/1 green Plant creature token, then put a +1/+1
# counter on each Plant you control" (CR 603.2c, 111.1, 122.1). Bot1 pays Roots with Mox Jet and Mox Emerald on turn 1 and Faithless Looting
# with Mox Ruby, discarding Grizzly Bears and Ornithopter into the graveyard (entering a graveyard is not leaving it: no trigger). On turn 3
# Raise Dead returns Grizzly Bears: a Plant token is created and then gets its counter, a 1/2 (the counter goes on the token the same ability
# made). The second Raise Dead (Swamp) returns the Ornithopter: a second Plant is created, and both get a counter, the first Plant 2/3 and the
# new one 1/2. The Grizzly Bears and the Ornithopter in hand get nothing.

